# Read project docs first

Before writing code, read `docs/project-overview.md` and the first open item in `docs/progress-tracker.md`. Then open only the matching doc:

- UI: `docs/ui-context.md`
- Structure or dependencies: `docs/architecture.md`
- Components: `docs/code-standards.md`
- PWA or Vercel: `docs/pwa-deploy.md`
- Geolocation: `docs/bonus-geolocation.md` only when the current milestone is P2

## Work rules

- Do one milestone at a time. Do not start the next priority early.
- Stack is Vite, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, React Router, and vite-plugin-pwa. No backend.
- Write layout and logic yourself. Do not copy WeGame source.
- After finishing a milestone, check it in `docs/progress-tracker.md` and add a one-line result.
- Reply to the user in Chinese.
- If a requirement or choice is unclear, ask the user before acting.
- If any command fails, is blocked, or does not match expectations, explain what happened and ask before retrying or switching approach.
- Typecheck only with `npm run typecheck`. Do not pass `--noEmit false` or other flags that make `tsc` write JavaScript.
